msgstr "模仿滿貫"

msgid "Mangan"
msgstr "滿貫"

msgid "Mangan base"
msgstr "滿貫基本"

msgid "Mangan dealer tsumo"
msgstr "滿貫莊家自摸"

msgid "Mangan if your hand was 1112345678999 in one suit, and you won via its nine-sided wait."
msgstr "若你的手牌為同一花色的 1112345678999，並以其九面聽和牌，則為滿貫。"

msgid "Mangan is achieved at 4.5 han 30 fu, 3.5 han 50 fu, or 2.5 han 90 fu. Haneman is still 6+ han."
msgstr "4.5 番 30 符、3.5 番 50 符或 2.5 番 90 符即可達成滿貫。跳滿仍為 6 番以上。"

msgid "Mangan ron"
msgstr "滿貫榮和"

msgid "Mangan tsumo"
msgstr "滿貫自摸"

msgid "Manzu"
msgstr "萬子"

msgid "Manzu Honitsu"
msgstr "萬子混一色"

