msgid "Open fuutsu are worth 8 fu, and closed fuutsu are worth 16. Just like with kans, you get a replacement tile for calling fuun. Unlike with kans, this replacement tile comes from the live wall, not the dead wall."
msgstr "明風雲價值 8 符，暗風雲價值 16 符。就如同槓一般，鳴風雲可獲得補牌。與槓不同的是，此補牌來自活牌山而非王牌區。"

msgid "Opposing winds are also round winds. So in East round, West is also a round wind."
msgstr "對向風牌也是場風。因此在東風圈中，西也是場風。"

