msgid "Scores are rounded to the nearest 10, maxing out at 1000 points (considered kazumangan, 4000/6000). Having 7+ han qualifies you for hanemangan (8000/12000). Some hands are shoumangan (6000/9000). Hands that are yakuman in riichi are daimangan (12000/18000), with the exception of chuurenpoutou, which is choumangan (16000/24000)"
